## 1. Purpose

This policy limits lending to related parties of Contoso Demo Bank.

## 2. Scope

Applies to directors, officers, and owners at or above the ownership threshold, and to entities they control.

## 3. Thresholds

- A related party is {{ facts.related_party_ownership_threshold }} ownership or a board seat.
- Approval authority is the {{ facts.related_party_approval }}.
- Maximum aggregate related-party exposure is {{ facts.max_related_party_exposure }}.
- The bank originates {{ facts.related_party_unsecured_ban }}.

## 4. Authority

Only the {{ facts.related_party_approval }} may approve related-party credit. Product committees cannot waive this policy.

## 5. Related policies

See Unsecured Consumer (CP-UCL-2026-01) and Exceptions and Override (CP-EXC-2026-01).
